---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';import {site} from '../data/site';
const links=Object.entries(site.links).filter(([,url])=>!url.startsWith('YOUR_'));
---
<Layout title="About & credits"><div class="wrap"><PageHeader title="A student’s notebook, shared." description="Free study resources for D.El.Ed students in Assam." kicker="ABOUT D.EL.ED BUDDY" back="/about/" backLabel="About"/><div class="two-col"><article class="content-panel prose"><h2>A little help between classes.</h2><p>D.El.Ed Buddy brings the syllabus, notes and practical guidance together, starting with Semester 1.</p><p>Use Study Notes for a focused read. Detailed Notes and one-page unit Infographics will join the collection as they become ready.</p><a class="text-link" href="/materials/">Explore study materials →</a></article><aside class="feature-panel"><span class="eyebrow">CREATED BY</span><h2>Sayeem Sadik</h2><p>Also known as <strong>Leo Aristocrat</strong>.</p><p>A fellow D.El.Ed student, sharing notes and useful resources.</p>{links.length>0&&<div class="personal-links">{links.map(([name,url])=><a href={url}>{name} ↗</a>)}</div>}</aside></div><section class="spaced"><details id="disclaimer"><summary>Disclaimer, sources & content policy</summary><p>D.El.Ed Buddy is an independent student project, unaffiliated with SCERT Assam, NCTE or any government authority. Check official notices and requirements at their original source.</p><p>Curriculum: SCERT Assam, Revised Curriculum-Syllabus 2024. Study notes: Sayeem Sadik / Leo Aristocrat.</p><p>Share original or permitted material with appropriate attribution.</p></details><p id="contact" class="small muted spaced">Contact details will be added here.</p></section></div></Layout>